  "raw_label": "-1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Alluri Sudheer Babu vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 9 September, 2020 Author: K. Suresh Reddy Bench: K. Suresh Reddy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice K. Suresh Reddy Criminal Petition No.3097 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "The alleged offences against the petitioner are under sections 188, 273, 307, 328, 336, 353, 420 r/w 34 of Indian Penal Code, 1860 (for short 'IPC'), Section 8 (c) r/w 20 of Narcotic Drugs and Psychotropic Substances Act, 1985 and Sections 58, 59, 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act,2006.",
    "arguments": "2. Heard the counsel for the petitioner and the Additional Public Prosecutor appearing for the respondent / State. 3. A reading of the first information report discloses that on 27.5.2020 at about 5.00 pm., Inspector of Police, Nallapadu Police Station, along with his staff proceeded to NH-16 Flyover, Etukuru Junction, Guntur Rural Mandal, intersepted the car bearing No.AP 07 BN 8586, apprehended the petitioner and seized 15 sacks of Mukbar, 5 sacks of Khalaja and 5 sacks of Zarda and 5 Kgs of Ganja from his possession. 4. Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the petitioner has filed Crl.M.P.No.978 of 2020 before the learned Special Judge Constituted under Narcotic Drugs and Psychotropic Substances Act- cum-I Additional Sessions Judge, Guntur, seeking statutory bail and the learned Judge dismissed the said petition by its order dated 31.7.2020.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "2. Heard the counsel for the petitioner and the Additional Public Prosecutor appearing for the respondent / State. 3. A reading of the first information report discloses that on 27.5.2020 at about 5.00 pm., Inspector of Police, Nallapadu Police Station, along with his staff proceeded to NH-16 Flyover, Etukuru Junction, Guntur Rural Mandal, intersepted the car bearing No.AP 07 BN 8586, apprehended the petitioner and seized 15 sacks of Mukbar, 5 sacks of Khalaja and 5 sacks of Zarda and 5 Kgs of Ganja from his possession. 4. Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the petitioner has filed Crl.M.P.No.978 of 2020 before the learned Special Judge Constituted under Narcotic Drugs and Psychotropic Substances Act- cum-I Additional Sessions Judge, Guntur, seeking statutory bail and the learned Judge dismissed the said petition by its order dated 31.7.2020.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
  },
